iginal_code":"746.2203(b)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-19","finding":"Written Activity Plans - Plan Followed by Caregiver: Written lesson plans and daily schedules were observed posted in all classsrooms. However some of the caregivers were not aware of the planned activitties and schedule was not being followed. One of the of five groups of children present was observed participating in the planned activity listed in the lesson plan. Infant children do not participate in outdoor play and a child was observed using a tablet to play a game.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026267405","violation_type_title":"Written Activity Plans - Plan Followed by Caregiver (26 TAC §746.2203(b))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726-v2","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-603-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726","date":"2022-07-26","original_code":"746.603(a)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-19","finding":"Children's Records Maintained: One of out six children's records reviewed is missing medical care information, permission to transport, parent/child address, emergency contact address and special care statement.","topic":"fire","source_record_id":"1026307615","violation_type_title":"Children's Records Maintained (26 TAC §746.603(a))","topic_label":"Fire safety & emergency drills"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726-v3","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-1309-e","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726","date":"2022-07-26","original_code":"746.1309(e)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-19","finding":"Documented Annual Training- Required Content: Six staff training record were reviewed. One staff members CPR training expired on 3/31/2022. A second file is missing trainings on transportation, abuse/neglect, safe sleep / shaken baby/ early brain development, hazardous materials, food allergies, medications, emergency preparedness, building and physical premises safety and communicable diseases. A third file is missing trainings on  hazardous materials, food allergies, medications, emergency preparedness, building and physical premises safety and communicable diseases.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026267406","violation_type_title":"Documented Annual Training- Required Content (26 TAC §746.1309(e))","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726-v4","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-3701","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726","date":"2022-07-26","original_code":"746.3701","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-19","finding":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards: Outdoor fence had two loose planks of wood; one of them had nails sticking out. Another area of the fence had three protruding screws.     There is a TV in the prek room and another one in the school-age room. Both TV are on top of cabinets and not anchored nor mounted.     Note: Fence was fixed during inspection when provider nailed the nails and screws.","topic":"safety","source_record_id":"1026508422","violation_type_title":"Safety - Areas Free From Hazards (26 TAC §746.3701)","topic_label":"Safety hazards"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726-v5","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-901","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726","date":"2022-07-26","original_code":"746.901","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-19","finding":"Required Personnel Records: Two staff files are missing 1-7 hours of pre-service training. A third file is missing copy of ID, employment date and high school diploma/GED. A fourth file is missing orientation statement.","topic":"staffing","source_record_id":"1026307614","violation_type_title":"Required Personnel Records (26 TAC §746.901)","topic_label":"Staff qualifications & clearances"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2605-1-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220726","date":"2022-07-26","original_code":"746.2605(1)(A)","severity":"medium","severity_label":"Medium risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2022-08-19","finding":"Furnishings and Equipment for Pre-Kindergarten Age Interest Centers Clearly Defined: The todddler and multi-purpose rooms are regularly used for prek age children. These rooms do not have well defined interest centers.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026307616","violation_type_title":"Furnishings and Equipment for Pre-Kindergarten Age Interest Centers Clearly Defined (26 TAC §746.2605(1)(A))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"}]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220601","date":"2022-06-01","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905847695","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905847695","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-06-01","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220518","date":"2022-05-18","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"No deficiencies cited","passed":true,"violation_count":0,"open_count":0,"evidence_class":"VERIFIED","provenance":{"source_id":"tx_hhsc_activities","source_record_id":"905847694","url":"https://data.texas.gov/resource/m5q4-3y3d.json?activity_id=905847694","retrieved_at":"2026-11-05T21:27:29.718Z","effective_date":"2022-05-18","evidence_class":"VERIFIED"},"occurrences":[]},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1373501-i20220509","date":"2022-05-09","inspection_type":"Inspection","result":"Deficiencies cited","passed":false,"violation_count":2,"open_count":0,"evidence_c